{"id":"vod_bf_2106","vodId":"2106","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"半田君传说","name_cn":"半田君传说","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-3/3c058b8fa407d76f8daced377ee905d7.jpg"},"summary":"半田清舟（岛崎信长 配音）身为著名书道家半天清明的儿子，有着一段不同寻常的童年。半田拥有英俊的外表和聪慧的头脑，却偏偏性格内向不善言辞，接二连三的误会让他成为了同学们眼中的“怪咖”，而向来笨口拙舌的半田自然无法替自己正名，就这样，校园中关于“半田之壁”传说不胫而走，总是曲解他人好意的半田该如何翻身？　　总是戏弄半田的川藤鹰生（兴津和幸 配音）、成绩优异具有领导气质的相泽顺一（广濑裕也 配音）、样貌英俊总与半田较劲的二阶堂礼绪（柿原彻也 配音）、 身强体壮的肌肉男筒井茜（细谷佳正 配音）、和半田境遇相似的近藤幸男（山下大辉 配音），在他们的陪伴和帮助之下，半田最终能否走出心灵的桎梏，获得周遭的认同呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 22:33:32","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/bantianjunchuanshuo/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:09.543Z"}